        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2003/24, Modern Series 24\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 24 Inch Towel Bar is available in four hot finish colors that make it a great choice for chic bathroom remodels. This Modern Series 24 Inch Towel Bar is easy to install and comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. This bath towel bar is made out of solid brass for long-lasting durability against steamy bathroom environments. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2003-24-specifications.gif?v=1704354778\" width=\"563\" height=\"195\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-18-inch-towel-bar-deltana-55d2002-18\"><b>18\" 55D Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-double-towel-bar-deltana-55d2006\"><b>24\" 55D Series Double Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 24 Inch Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 24-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 22-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length Including Mount: 23-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance from Wall to the Bar: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2003-24-specifications.pdf?v=1691095323\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2003/24 24\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
